    'eyes-glamourgoblin-1107': { pri: 2, group: G2, title: 'The child under the glamour: a goblin her size, in her own clothes, empty-handed, in all eight facings (11-07)', pt: 'the Halfway Inn and the lake, the desk of 11-07 (tools/goblinchild-sheet.py goblinchild_p1; deep16/data/foes.js glamourgoblin; js/inn.js In.KINDS, the wagon\'s and the due\'s kid; js/secondact.js) · eyes',
      url: 'deep16/?gallery&shelf=creatures&rows=glamourgoblin&fresh=1107gg',
      look: 'The art desk\'s goblin for the illusion (your "goblin in the barn if they fail to reveal the illusion"): the child\'s 35 px, her olive smock, hood, brown trousers and boots, green skin and wide ears, no weapon -- so when the glamour breaks only the body changes. , . to turn it, RIGHT to the WALK. The skin snapped to the gold (a yellow goblin) on six facings: kept to the green now. Every walk is the art desk\'s own HOLD (the legs do not trade cleanly) -- cut as drawn, on the dream list. It is the look of the wagon\'s goblin, the one in the barn\'s end stall, and the due night\'s, in place of the armed warrior goblin they wore.' },
    // NERISSE IN HER HUMAN FORM (the art desk's ART-125 batches G and H, cut by the desk of 11-07 on his "got some more for human form Nerisse in Fresh")
    'eyes-nerisse-face-1107': { pri: 2, group: G2, title: 'Nerisse\'s talking portrait at the inn\'s hearth table, and the Blue looking out of her (11-07)', pt: 'the lamia at the Halfway Inn, the desk of 11-07 (tools/portrait-sheet.py nerisse; deep16/art/pt_nerisse; deep16/js/counter.js C.anyPt) · eyes',
      url: 'deep16/?portraits&who=nerisse&fresh=1107nf',
      look: 'The art desk\'s Nerisse (art-wanted 29, batch G): the sand robe and brown sash, the gold circlet with its teal stone, a cup by her hand. IDLE: a breath and a blink. ATTENTIVE, WELCOMING, SKEPTICAL, CONCERNED: her own face. Then THE BLUE: the same pose as ATTENTIVE, the eyes gone blue-white, the stone lit, a pale light at the temples and throat. And BLUESPEAK, six: the Blue talking through her, the light pulsing. The moods and the Blue were drawn bigger and came out a brighter gold robe; they are toned to the idle\'s sand now, so the robe should not jump from face to face (CONCERNED is a hair warmer). On the shelf only: her talk at the inn is the lamia lane\'s, held on your "Wait for the inn".' },
    'eyes-nerisse-wound-1107': { pri: 1, group: G2, title: 'THE WOUND THAT ENDS HER DISGUISE: the robed woman struck, then the lamia revealed (11-07)', pt: 'the lamia at the Halfway Inn, the desk of 11-07 (tools/lamia-sheet.py `stillflinch`; deep16/js/battle.js hurt, js/ui.js unitObj, js/show.js stageFor; mode=wound1107) · eyes',
      url: 'deep16/?gallery&shelf=creatures&rows=lamia&fresh=1107nw',
      look: 'Your "Build it now". RIGHT to STILLFLINCH, the last row: she stands as the robed woman, the fighter\'s blow lands, and she is struck -- a half step back, a hand to her side, straightening -- then her REVEAL plays straight on, then the lion\'s idle. E again to replay, , . to turn her: the struck woman as tall as her STILL from every side, the gold holding (the art desk\'s pages came mauve from the front and olive from behind, each toned to its view\'s STILL); her sash brown here, red on STILL, as drawn. In a fight (deep16/?show=lamia, or the Pocket DM) a blow on her before her first turn plays it so, where before it popped her to the lion with no reveal. The same wound now plays the roper\'s, the gargoyle\'s and the grick\'s Reveal too (they had the same pop).' },
    // SIGNY THE ROPE-MAKER (the art desk's ART-123-SIGNY batches B and C, art-wanted section 26, cut by the desk of 11-07 on his "we got a request for 'signy' in fresh")
